OL,3,AWizz Air flight from London in
OL,4,Aemergency landing after bomb threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Wizz Air flight travelling from
OL,7,FLondon Luton Airport to Sofia has been
OL,8,Fescorted by a Hungarian fighter jet to
OL,9,FBudapest after a mid-air bomb threat.
OL,11,FThe aircraft was forced to make an
OL,12,Femergency landing at Budapest Liszt
OL,13,FFerenc International.
OL,15,FAuthorities there "carried out the
OL,16,Fnecessary security checks on the
OL,17,Faircraft and passengers", a
OL,18,Fspokesperson for Wizz Air said.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
