OL,3,AWizz Air flight from London in
OL,4,Aemergency landing after bomb threat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe airline later confirmed an
OL,7,Finspection had been "completed and
OL,8,Fnothing was found", adding that the
OL,9,Fplane would depart again shortly.
OL,10,FHungarian Defence Minister Romulusz
OL,11,FRuszin-Szendis confirmed his country
OL,12,Fprovided the fighter jet to escort the
OL,13,Fflight.
